 Density Wave Theory (Spiral Arms):**  
  Just as hundreds of billions of stars align into razor-thin spiral arms under background gravitational potential waves, infinite numbers align into ultra-thin $O(1/N)$ resonance margin lanes.
* **Fluid Dynamic and Phase Space Interpretation of the 4-Cycle Loop:**  
  The 8-item periodic loop ($4 \to 16 \to 37 \to 58 \to 89 \to 145 \to 42 \to 20 \to 4$) into which unhappy numbers are drawn represents a periodic Fatou component in complex dynamics, formalized as a von Kármán vortex street (recirculating dead-lock flow) in fluid mechanics.
* **Hilbert–Pólya Spectral Constraint for the Riemann Hypothesis:**  
  Particles collapsing from ultra-large numbers to $\le 8,100$ are bound by the eigenvalue spectrum of the CNS differential operator $\mathcal{L}_F = F(z)\frac{d}{dz}$ under self-adjointness ($\mathcal{L}_F = \mathcal{L}_F^*$), inexorably drawn into the global attractor $z=1$ (the fluid stagnation point / gravitational center).

